Joucaw
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
ZIOCE 8 FACE_ALL
ZIOCE 10 FACE_ALL
ZIOCE 1 FACE_ALL
ZIOCE 7 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE ZIOCE ZIOCE
OR
    AND
        DEST Empty
        DEST Size >= 2
    DEST Empty
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL ZIOCE Empty
        PILE ALL ZIOCE Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL ZIOCE Empty
        PILE ALL ZIOCE Empty
